  <item>
    <title>EP21.一辈子能有几个有贼心有贼胆的夏天！（上集）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693fd5b037f52a644e0cbc2f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">693fd5b037f52a644e0cbc2f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Dec 2025 09:57:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“夏天都快过完了，好像就只是跑来跑去，什么事都没有做。”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>夏末秋初我们录了本期播客，终于在这个瞎忙的Q4剪辑出来了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间好像真的过得越来越快了，不禁让我们质疑地球的转速。F人就是很爱这种抽象的话题。本期聊得太长了，我们将分成两集放送！</span></p><span></span><p><span>活在当下吧朋友们~ （举杯）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【哪里找我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙/苹果播客/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/spotify荔枝FM &nbsp;同步更新</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期线索】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 一辈子能有几个有贼心有贼胆的夏天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">06:37</a> 地球是不是重启了，我请问呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 睡觉也无法给我充满电了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="923">15:23</a> 三十年，弹指一挥间罢了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1312">21:52</a> 找个知根知底的人哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1816">30:16</a> 再也无法集中的 注意力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2332">38:52</a> 十分想念小时候的无聊感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2396">39:56</a> 盲盒就是一场豪赌啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 不再过临时的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3034">50:34</a> 人是随时都会狗带的生物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3446">57:26</a> 好像没有以前那么喜欢生活了 &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3784">1:03:04</a> 还是要有发现新鲜事物的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>暴躁菜菜</span></p><span></span><p><span>觉醒桃子</span></p><span></span><p><span>【屁事处理中心】是一档由桃子和菜菜主持的纪实类聊天播客节目。我们以非典型30+女性视角观察世界，试图与生活中的“屁事”和解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>真诚永远动人，欢迎来到桃子和菜菜的世界！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63821c66f6753f4e9d4d5870/lg3ZQYDLn8ktWHAHh6HvpyNyUavA.m4a" length="76007324" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:19</itunes:duration>
