    <pubDate>Mon, 13 May 2024 13:04:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期串台播客，我们邀请到了隔壁电台“茶熟欧”的大许，一起聊聊热门台剧《不够善良的我们》！毫无疑问这是一部制作精良的佳作，无论是演员表现还是讨论的话题，都非常精彩。但是主播们对人物角色和故事情节，还是有些困惑。希望看过的听友们一起讨论~</span></p><span></span><p><span>指路 → </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/650fd460bbe351e616bc2873" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/650fd460bbe351e616bc2873"><span>茶熟欧</span></a><span> &nbsp;欢迎串门，欢迎👏🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span>当然了，欢迎听友们进群一起研究屁事哲学，欢迎留言、分享、投稿！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llyxQcSWKBrDYd31fNYkes8JUcNJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【本期线索】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 为什么会看《不够善良的我们》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="165">02:45</a> 关于导演徐誉庭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">06:03</a> 看剧的第一感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">10:16</a> 我们是不是对40岁的已婚女性有什么误解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="736">12:16</a> 男主到底在搞什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="953">15:53</a> 不够善良如何体现在每个角色上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1862">31:02</a> 不够善良想表达什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2168">36:08</a> 主播们的Rebecca时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2422">40:22</a> 吐槽妆造</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2529">42:09</a> 如何理解简庆芬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2830">47:10</a> 豆瓣短评果然人才辈出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2903">48:23</a> 简和Re, 到底谁更幸福</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3094">51:34</a> 打分玄学 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><h1><span>蔡健雅 Tanya Chua -《芬蘭距離 Finland》</span></h1><span></span><p><strong><span>蔡健雅 Tanya Chua - 《Rebecca》</span></strong></p><span></span><h1><span>蔡健雅 Tanya Chua -《善良的我們 Learn To Live Again》</span></h1><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>菜菜/桃子/大许</span></p><span></span><p><span>【哪里找我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙/苹果播客/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/spotify/荔枝FM &nbsp;同步更新</span></p><span></span><p><span>【屁事处理中心】是一档由桃子和菜菜主持的纪实类聊天播客节目。我们以非典型30+女性视角观察世界，试图与生活中的“屁事”和解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>真诚永远动人，欢迎来到桃子和菜菜的世界！</span></p>]]></description>
