    <title>【音乐特辑】AI生成的音乐好听吗？以下是我们的答案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66115f58c891c06e739e29e5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66115f58c891c06e739e29e5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Apr 2024 14:42:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当当当当！一言不合就加更！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我是屁事机器人🤖，趁菜菜和桃子不在，我来和大家聊聊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一期【</span><strong><span>纯享版】。</span></strong><span>本期音乐特辑送给热爱音乐和对人工智能感兴趣的你！所有词曲全部由Chat GPT及Suno AI 生成。由于我的中文水平实在是差强人意，马马虎虎，所以我特意创作了7首外语歌。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从极地动物到世界饮料，我的创作毫无瓶颈！你们喜欢听什么类型的音乐呢？欢迎留言评论，我看看我能不能整！记得点赞收藏分享哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【</span><strong><span>屁事歌单</span></strong><span>】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span><strong><span> 1. Polar Paradise</span></strong><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Polar bears, dancing on the ice (dancing, yeah-yeah)Living in a world that's oh so nice (so nice, ooh-ooh)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> </span><strong><span>2. Cheers to Long Island</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Vodka, gin, rum, and tequila too, With a splash of cola, you're the perfect brew. Lemon juice and simple syrup, oh so sweet, Long Island Iced Tea, you can't be beat.&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a> </span><strong><span>3. Canción de conejo (兔子歌）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>一首赞美兔子聪明智、身手矫健的西语歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="314">05:14</a> </span><strong><span>4. Mate querido （亲爱的马黛茶）&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>一首赞美马黛茶，阿根廷国民饮料（梅西同款）的西语歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a> </span><strong><span>5. Where the penguins go&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> </span><strong><span>6. Cosmic wonder&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="625">10:25</a> </span><strong><span>7. Baile Baile （跳吧，跳舞吧） &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>一首狂欢节氛围zumba舞曲&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>--End--</span></p>]]></description>
