  <item>
    <title>EP14. 回忆满满 | 没有手机的小时候，怎么那么有意思啊！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c2cbd1b6c9256aeea5e10f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c2cbd1b6c9256aeea5e10f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 07 Feb 2024 00:16:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位小朋友大家好，今天的《大风车》节目开始了！今天呀有两个小朋友来到了我们的节目里，她们是爱吃桃的桃子和爱吃菜的菜菜！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目中大家将见证两位小朋友迎接千禧年，穿越青春期，披荆斩棘，调皮捣蛋的心路历程！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时光飞船即将起航，请系好安全带，梦回90年代！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们屁事处理中心有听友群啦！快来拉上亲朋好友，扫码加入吧~ 欢迎大家分享生活趣闻以及想要听到的话题。二位主播会认真看留言，尽量做到有求必应！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmeCwdfe8Z8eOlr2PkZ3WhYBYYFd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【本期线索】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:16</a> 被偶像剧支配的青春期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="527">08:47</a> 青春疼痛文学，我没你不行！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">14:59</a> 恐怖故事我最爱，一到夜晚就歇菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">16:24</a> 一本6块4，这属于是天价了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> 租碟的快乐你根本想象不到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1479">24:39</a> 没有手机的日子怎么听歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1691">28:11</a> 看书成了最后的解药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1904">31:44</a> 奇奇怪怪的收集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">35:10</a> 小孩和小狗有啥区别！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2306">38:26</a> 橡皮，我的童年爱马仕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2736">45:36</a> 开学前的仪式感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 食堂：我谢谢你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3068">51:08</a> 谁还不是葬爱家族呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3255">54:15</a> 过年！我最爱过年！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>太多了，我不写了</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>菜菜/桃子</span></p><span></span><p><span>【哪里找我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙/苹果播客/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/spotify &nbsp;同步更新</span></p><span></span><p><span>【屁事处理中心】是一档由桃子和菜菜主持的纪实类聊天播客节目。我们以非典型30+女性视角观察世界，试图与生活中的“屁事”和解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>真诚永远动人，欢迎来到桃子和菜菜的世界！</span></p>]]></description>
