  <item>
    <title>EP13. 欢迎来到我的家乡哈尔滨，welcome to东北！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65a79caeab66818faf54adb0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65a79caeab66818faf54adb0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Jan 2024 09:23:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>没错！我俩都是哈尔滨银，最近家乡火起来了我们超级开心！赶紧录制了一期哈尔滨旅行指北✈️</span></p><span></span><p><span>号外号外！喜大普奔！我们屁事处理中心有听友群啦！快来拉上亲朋好友，扫码加入吧~ 欢迎大家分享生活趣闻以及想要听到的话题。二位主播会认真看留言，尽量做到有求必应！</span></p><span></span><p><span>二维码会过期，也可以后台回复「听友群」，获取入群方式</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjOkov284SDB0vptOaAp242JwM_l.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 进入正题 热爱和泪珠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a> 陌生的滨子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">06:12</a> 哈尔滨的烧烤，谁吃了不说一声好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a> 砂锅坛肉汤泡饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1277">21:17</a> 哈尔滨初雪必吃：铁锅炖 &nbsp;（大鹅们瑟瑟发抖）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1552">25:52</a> 一些远近驰名的东北菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> 一些边境特色：俄餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2101">35:01</a> 火出圈儿的道里菜市场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2314">38:34</a> 沉浸式带你逛中央大街、索菲亚、江边儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2823">47:03</a> 冰雪大世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2964">49:24</a> 试了就戒不掉的洗浴文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3378">56:18</a> 罪证陈列馆，731遗址</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3981">1:06:21</a> 家人们谁懂</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>红高粱模特队 - 赵本山</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>菜菜/桃子</span></p><span></span><p><span>【哪里找我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙/苹果播客/喜马拉雅/网易云音乐/spotify &nbsp;同步更新</span></p><span></span><p><span>【屁事处理中心】是一档由桃子和菜菜主持的纪实类聊天播客节目。我们以非典型30+女性视角观察世界，试图与生活中的“屁事”和解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>真诚永远动人，欢迎来到桃子和菜菜的世界！</span></p>]]></description>
